dhb
------------------------------------------
DHB (Dynamic Hashed Blocks) is a high-performance data structure designed for
sparse dynamic graphs and matrices.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libdhb-devel-1.0.0+git20260923-1bl2
  libdhb1-1.0.0+git20260923-1bl2
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libCatch2-devel-3.16.1-1bl2
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/hu-macsy/dhb

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/hu-macsy/dhb.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack dhb-1.0.0+git20260923-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./dhb-1.0.0+git20260923-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/dhb-1.0.0+git20260923-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/dhb-1.0.0+git20260923-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdhb1-1.0.0+git20260923-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdhb-devel-1.0.0+git20260923-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(dhb)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/dhb.README
  /usr/share/doc/dhb/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/dhb/README.md

(libdhb1)
  /usr/bin/cygdhb-1.dll

(libdhb-devel)
  /usr/include/dhb/batcher.h
  /usr/include/dhb/block.h
  /usr/include/dhb/buckets.h
  /usr/include/dhb/dynamic_hashed_blocks.h
  /usr/include/dhb/graph.h
  /usr/include/dhb/hash_tools.h
  /usr/include/dhb/integer_log2.h
  /usr/include/dhb/submatrix.h
  /usr/include/dhb/vec.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/dhb/dhbConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/dhb/dhbConfigVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/dhb/dhbTargets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/dhb/dhbTargets.cmake
  /usr/lib/libdhb.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/dhb.pc

